message: "If you use this software or its evaluation data, please cite this repository. The accompanying technical report is an empirical note, not peer reviewed."
type: software
title: "LogitTrail: Local Typed Decisions from Frozen Language-Model Logits"
authors:
  - family-names: "Oshio"
    given-names: "Yuki"
    website: "https://github.com/yuki-oshio"
abstract: "Formerly Mini Jev; renamed on 2026-09-29 to distinguish the project from r-ms/mini-jev. A local typed-decision API, reusable residual-head training workflow, and transparent empirical evaluation. The measured native configuration uses a frozen language model; it is not a reproduction of TypeSafe Jev or RLCD."
repository-code: "https://github.com/UpHash-Network/mini-jev"
license: MIT
keywords:
